{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026101RBvWxSj1794798642.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地上月主要經濟數據全部差過市場預期。</p><p></p><p>上月社會消費品零售總額，按年升幅放緩至百分之0.4，低於市場預期的百分之0.8。</p><p></p><p>工業增加值增長百分之4.8，增速較9月減慢0.7個百分點。</p><p></p><p>至於反映基建及房屋等施工量的固定資產投資，首10個月跌幅進一步擴大至百分之8.1。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.410394+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T15:13:02.888747+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:45:11.742635+00:00","content_hash":"17e3f728b2224ffca4841dff952640a8c128554a74d75f52259843a2413c7abc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.410394+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}